    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\"><span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span><span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Hashing</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Canonical key</span><a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/group-anagrams/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 49</a></div>\n  <h1>Group Anagrams</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Insight in one line: give every word a canonical key that is equal exactly for anagrams (its 26 letter counts, or its sorted letters), then one hash map from key to bucket does all the grouping. O(N &middot; K) time with counts, O(N &middot; K log K) with sorting.</p>\n"
